Subject: [PATCH] fixup! feat(v2): add C17a deterministic fee-backed UTXO
 expiry and cleaning-crew validation

Regenerate getblockstats chain commitments for C17a versioned coin provenance. An external hash control reproduces the old state root by removing precisely the new17-byte metadata trailer and the current root with that trailer present. Keep the existing four-spend graph,225-byte v7 frames and every numeric statistic unchanged. Existing LOTUS_ALLOW_LEGACY_TX is generator-admission-only; a normal peer accepts all103 blocks, and the unchanged standard rpc_getblockstats test fails before and passes after without any override. No production or assertion changes.
